### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Get a CSRF token before login, registration, logout, or any other write request.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf
> {% client.global.set("csrfHeader", response.body.headerName); client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token); %}

### Login with a seed user. The browser/HTTP client receives a server session cookie.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "username": "musiclover42",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Return the listener represented by the current session cookie.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me

### Register a new listener and start a session immediately.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "username": "new_listener_{{$timestamp}}",
  "emailAddress": "new.listener.{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "gender": "Female",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-01-01",
  "countryName": "United States"
}

### Logout and invalidate the server session.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfToken}}
